{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"easter_eggs/locales/kr/18010321/document_615.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/document_18010321_615","lang":"kr","texts":{"document:615":{"text":"아래에 작은 글씨로 한 줄이 적혀 있다.\n내가 어린 시절 살았던 곳.","source_cn":"下面有一行小字：\n余幼时生活之地。","status":"matched","document_title":"「순결한 땅」","document_title_cn":"《纯净之地》","document_title_status":"matched"}},"speakers":{}},"easter_eggs/menus/18010321_1_2.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_18010321:1:2","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:515900281:1":{"text":"최근 큰 소식이 하나 있어.","source_cn":"最近有个大消息。","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族格登幻象":{"text":"귀족 고든의 환영","source":"贵族格登幻象","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/kr/ep8/env_story/18315010.json":{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18315010","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18315010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1831501001:0":{"text":"여기도 말하는 환영이 있네.","source_cn":"这里也有幻象在说话。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4C5941FF90A1A35D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"여기도 말하는 환영이 있네.","female":"여기도 말하는 환영이 있네.","variant_male_record_index":"248740","variant_female_record_index":"248741","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep8/env_story/18315020.json":{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18315020","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18315020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1831502001:0":{"text":"그 얘기 들었어?","source_cn":"听说了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E9EEDF347C5F1DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1831502002:0":{"text":"무슨 얘기?","source_cn":"什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7292801EA862E2A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族格登幻象":{"text":"귀족 고든의 환영","source":"贵族格登幻象","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族瑞嘉娜幻象":{"text":"귀족 레가나의 환영","source":"贵族瑞嘉娜幻象","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep8/env_story/18315030.json":{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18315030","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18315030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1831503001:1":{"text":"모티머 님께서 새로운 후계자를 정하신 것 같아. 노바리스의 영주가 곧 바뀌겠군.","source_cn":"莫蒂默殿下似乎已经选定新的继承人了，恐怕不日诺珐斯就会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDEA4CC4278E2AE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1831503002:1":{"text":"그래? 그게 누구지?","source_cn":"是吗？是谁来继承？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDD843C6804F5408","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1831503003:1":{"text":"테페시아 양이라고 하던걸? 옷차림은 아주 귀엽지만, 말투는 꽤 무례한 그 아가씨 말이야.","source_cn":"听说是苔佩希小姐。就是那位穿着很可爱，但说话很不客气的小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C62BAAED04B3E1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1831503004:1":{"text":"뭐? 그 아가씨는 노바리스에 거의 모습을 드러내지 않잖아?","source_cn":"怎么是她？她不是很少在诺珐斯露面吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CE7594D0DDCBEAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1831503005:1":{"text":"마법 재능이 뛰어나서 <style=\"highlight\">손짓 한 번으로 노바리스 내의 모든 박쥐를 곁으로 불러 모을 수 있다</style>고 하더군. 어쩌면 그래서 모티머 님의 선택을 받은 걸지도 모르지.","source_cn":"据说苔佩希小姐的魔法天赋很出众，<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB71D83B90F88E07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1831503006:1":{"text":"그럼 영주 자리를 계승하면 마법도 훨씬 강해지겠군. 역대 영주들의 힘은 평범한 뱀파이어와는 비교조차 안 될 만큼 막강했으니까.","source_cn":"那等她继承领主之位，魔法水平肯定会更上一层楼。历任领主...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EA5989D132A1640","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1831503007:1":{"text":"그럼 반티스의 박쥐들을 전부 노바리스까지 불러올 수 있는 건가? 하하.","source_cn":"那她说不定能把班题斯的蝙蝠也召唤到诺珐斯来，哈哈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1738C888C1E6C1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1831503008:1":{"text":"기회가 있다면 그 광경을 꼭 보고 싶군... 반티스의 그레이브본들이 어떤 표정을 지을까? 정말 볼만하겠지.","source_cn":"要是有机会，真想看看那个场景啊……班题斯那些亡灵的表情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF84CA15439F67045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族格登幻象":{"text":"귀족 고든의 환영","source":"贵族格登幻象","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族瑞嘉娜幻象":{"text":"귀족 레가나의 환영","source":"贵族瑞嘉娜幻象","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族德雷文幻象":{"text":"귀족 드레이븐의 환영","source":"贵族德雷文幻象","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep8/env_story/18315040.json":{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18315040","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18315040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1831504001:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">박쥐 소환</style>? 이게 이 거울의 정답인 것 같아.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>召唤蝙蝠</styl...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4ECACAAB08F3053D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"highlight\">박쥐 소환</style>? 이게 이 거울의 정답인 것 같아.","female":"<style=\"highlight\">박쥐 소환</style>? 이게 이 거울의 정답인 것 같아.","variant_male_record_index":"248754","variant_female_record_index":"248755","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep8/env_story/18315050.json":{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18315050","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18315050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1831505001:0":{"text":"박쥐를 두 마리밖에 소환하지 못했지만, 어쨌든 정답은 맞혔어...","source_cn":"虽然只召唤来了两只蝙蝠，好歹是答对了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA42F62FDB944F8BE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"박쥐를 두 마리밖에 소환하지 못했지만, 어쨌든 정답은 맞혔어...","female":"박쥐를 두 마리밖에 소환하지 못했지만, 어쨌든 정답은 맞혔어...","variant_male_record_index":"248756","variant_female_record_index":"248757","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female"